		{"id":"92a5325901d802ca","type":"text","text":"# Soft-IP\n• Synthesizable specification of architecture and algorithm at Register Transfer Level (RTL)  \n• Design does not include any physical information nor relation to any semiconductor process  \n• Design can be easily changed by parameters, but no precise numbers for performance, area, and power are available  \n• Customization options when integrating into a new design\n\n# Hard-IP\n• Specification of IP at a lower level (e. g., mask data for a certain silicon implementation)  \n• IP is immutable  \n• Metrics for area, performance and power consumption are very accurate  \n• Can be easily integrated into another design","x":12192,"y":4399,"width":708,"height":581},
