		{"id":"ad6c98ccd6e82629","type":"text","text":"# Assignment 8\n\nT1\nRetiming Transformation $D' = \\Gamma C + \\Lambda D \\geq M$\n- registers on edge - im m vector (edes)\n- $\\gamma^x, \\gamma ^y$ bestimmen durch ungleichungen lösen \n- &  versuche $\\Lambda = 1$ Einheitsmatrix \n- new indexspace\n\t- $I_x' = \\{i': i' = \\Lambda \\cdot i + \\gamma ^x, 1 \\leq i \\leq N\\}$ (2. Teil wie in angabe)\n\t- $I_y' = \\{i': i' = \\Lambda \\cdot i + \\gamma ^y, 1 \\leq i \\leq N\\}$\n\nT2\nsignal-flow-graph Dimension = 1 smaller than reduced dependance graph dimension ","x":5425,"y":17600,"width":526,"height":850},
